 *  Flash layout (confirmed from partition table):
 *    0x001000  Bootloader       (18 KB)
 *    0x008000  Partition table  (4 KB)
 *    0x010000  app0 / ota_0     (263 KB)  ← ACTIVE boot image
 *    0x150000  app1 / ota_1     (1092 KB) ← OTA update image
 *    0x290000  spiffs           (1408 KB) ← blank
 *    0x3F0000  coredump         (64 KB)   ← crash log present
