 *    GPIO5  → ₱1  hopper
 *    GPIO18 → ₱5  hopper
 *    GPIO19 → ₱10 hopper
 *    GPIO17 → ₱20 hopper
 *
 *  Function names extracted from binary:
 *    openhop, closehop, exchangeMoney, exchangeTerminate
 *
 *  Debug strings extracted from binary:
 *    "SYSTEM START"        "Total Money: %d"
 *    "Count %u"            "Split %d > FData : %s"
